    <briefdescription>
<para>Spatial index for efficient ground point queries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Divides the Earth&apos;s surface into geographic bins to quickly find which ground points are near a satellite&apos;s subsatellite point </para>
